                                "sense_id": "9fb68780-52d8-326a-ad99-9e38031e56cc",
                                "text": "She carried some rugs for me through the shrubbery in the darkling. \"They'll think we've gone mooning,\" she said, jerking her head at the household. \"I wonder what they make of us – criminals.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
